296 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 121 0 R
/E (From a young age, Baba showed a natural gift and interest in building construction. After his basic education, he went on to learn civil and structural construction at Awomolo Construction Company in Ibadan. He became well known for his ability to look at complex building plans, understand them deeply, and deduce how to build a strong and safe structure. )
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
297 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 121 0 R
/E (Pa Julius Omowaiye began his career working alongside expatriates from Germany in the construction industry for about three years. In 1973, with courage and determination, he started his own company. Through diligence, dedication, and tenacity, he became the CEO of J. Ola Omowaiye & Brothers Limited and J. Ola Omowaiye & Sons Limited. His work was marked by excellence, integrity, and a strong sense of accomplishment.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
