299 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 121 0 R
/E (Pa Julius Omowaiye married the love of his life, Mojisola Omowaiye on 15th June 1969. Their marriage was filled with love, friendship, respect, joy, and a shared dedication and loyalty to Jehovah. As a loving husband, Julius Omowaiye was hardworking, humble, loving, and deeply caring. He was a generous provider who always put his family first, and he was known for his hospitality and willingness to help others. He was intelligent, thoughtful, and always ready to teach and guide.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
