/P 123 0 R
/E (Pa Julius Omowaiye was admired for his strong faith, dedication, and the way he encouraged others spiritually. He also participated in convention dramas, including the "Love Never Fails" convention in 2019, and handled several convention assignments. One of the things he often said was, "Never leave Jehovah. Serve Him with a complete heart full of obedience." Sadly, on Sunday, February 15, 2026, Pa Julius Omowaiye fell asleep in death.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
