389 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 127 0 R
/E (Baba was a good Christian to reckon with. He was a father not just to his immediate family but also to the extended family and even to those who were not members of his family. One thing you can visibly observe when you join the family is an inseparable love instilled among Baba's children. Baba was an industrious person that alots of business organisations were ascribed, to his name E.g Waye Bakery, Omowaye Nur/Pry School. The Good shepherd Nur /Pry sch and many others. He was an accomplished Engineer whose work can be seen all-over Nigeria. Baba was an honest man who would always find /verify any case /information presented to him before accepting it as facts, baba would say''se eniyen lo so be. Above all,  Baba loved Jehovah fearlessly; he taught others to love Jehovah and do Jehovah's will. Today, we celebrate an Icon, an intellect, A reputable Engineer, an industrious personality. Baba Omowaye has indeed tread well on the surface of the earth. Rest on, Baba. - Rophina)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [10]
