402 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 128 0 R
/E (Daddy believed in me when I was just beginning my journey in life. To mention one out of many, He was the very first person who gave me the money to rent my first apartment. That single act of kindness became part of the foundation upon which I built my future. I can never forget it. Even in his old age and despite his health challenges, Daddy and Mummy honored me with their presence at my first daughter's wedding. That gesture spoke volumes about their love, thoughtfulness, and the greatness of Daddy's heart. Daddy lived a life marked by generosity, humility, and compassion. Although he is no longer with us, the legacy of his kindness will continue to live in the hearts of everyone whose life he touched. May Jehovah continue to comfort Mummy, the children, and the entire family. We eagerly await the wonderful time when Jehovah will call, and Daddy will answer. - Femi )
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
