<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 128 0 R
/E (The tribute of Baba o ni inu re: when Baba was alive, he stood by the family; he showed love and affection. Baba, we love you; keep on sleeping in the Lord. Baba sun re ni Aya Olugbala re, Good night Dad. - The Ajayi's Family)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [8]
>>
